NATO/OTAN is acknowledged for coordination-measure names and abbreviations
from AJP-3.3.5 Edition C Version 1, Annex B, and for the definition text
paraphrased or quoted in sources/measure-definitions.json. Doctrine definitions
remain in the cited publication. The catalogue does not imply NATO endorsement of openAIX.

The KDEN navigation examples and sources/kden-navigation.json hold data from the
Federal Aviation Administration's cycle 2610 public dataset. Its official
download URL and digest are recorded in sources/authorities.json.

DCS station numbers, Mission Editor labels and store class identifiers in
sources/dcs/aircraft-stations.json are facts about DCS World (Eagle Dynamics),
taken from the unit tables of Quaggles' dcs-lua-datamine; the revision and the
source digest are in sources/manifest.json.
